# "Destroy target creature": destruction is not "can't be regenerated" for indestructible (CR 702.12b). Bot1 casts Damn on
# Bot2's Ornithopter on turn three and Bot2 answers with Revitalizing Repast, giving it indestructible until end of turn
# (and a +1/+1 counter): the target is still legal, the spell resolves, and the Ornithopter survives with damage-free
# toughness 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Damn
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Revitalizing Repast
Mox Jet
Swamp x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Damn.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Revitalizing Repast.Cast(Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Damn
Bot2.Graveyard = Revitalizing Repast
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 3
